Q2  on the threshold_bound hops: gold score minus best DISTRACTOR score
    Lowering tau only helps if the correct fact outranks the distractors.
    A negative margin means the lower tau admits the distractor FIRST.
==============================================================================

  tau_ret in force: 0.5959   threshold_bound cases: 36
  with candidate data: 15   gold locatable: 2   no candidate data: 21

    POSITIVE margin (gold outranks every distractor)     0  (0%)  -> lowering tau is a real win
    NEGATIVE or zero margin                              2  (100%)  -> lowering tau admits a DISTRACTOR first
    margin: min -0.6569  median -0.4717  max -0.4717

    examples where the 'free win' is a precision trap:
      margin -0.6569  gold 0.2876 vs distractor 0.9445 | What is the instance of the given name of Chris Brink?
      margin -0.4717  gold 0.5247 vs distractor 0.9964 | Which country is the country of the capital of the administr

