  backward clears tau on 43 of 195
  ceiling if every one then verifies: (568+43)/800 = 0.764  [UPPER BOUND]

  NOT PROBED AT ALL: misparsed_chain, walk_completes_now, threshold_bound
  The original decomposition only ran the backward probe on
  not_retrieved/far_below. Until the misparses are probed too, whether
  they are a PARSE failure or a DIRECTION failure is unknown — and that
  is precisely what decides whether the emitter is needed for them.

